      "id": 2,
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "## Billable actions, from the customer side\n\nEvery panel reads `temporal_cloud_v1_billable_action_count` on the **Temporal Cloud OpenMetrics** endpoint (`prometheus-kind`) - the surface a customer actually has. This is the metric Temporal bills on.\n\n**The series is a per-second rate, published once per minute. It is not a counter - never `rate()` or `increase()` it.** A sample of `2.433` means 2.433 billable actions/sec averaged over that minute, i.e. ~146 actions in that minute.\n\n- **Actions in a window** = `sum_over_time(m[w]) * 60`. Exact, and gap-honest: a minute Cloud never published contributes nothing rather than being interpolated.\n- **Actions / min** on the graphs = `sum_over_time(m[$__interval]) * 3600 / $__interval_s`, so the graph buckets sum back to the same total.\n- **Projection** deliberately uses `avg_over_time` (mean of *published* minutes, extrapolated) - the one place where ignoring idle gaps is the intent.\n"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Billable actions (selected range)",
      "description": "Exact count over the dashboard time range: sum_over_time(billable[$__range]) * 60. Filtered by all five selectors. Minutes Cloud did not publish contribute zero - this undercounts across a scrape outage rather than inventing traffic.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 5,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 7
      },
      "id": 3,
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "decimals": 0,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "text",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          },
          "mappings": [],
          "noValue": "0"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "orientation": "auto",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "auto"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "sum(sum_over_time(temporal_cloud_v1_billable_action_count{temporal_namespace=~\"$namespace\", region=~\"$region\", temporal_workflow_type=~\"$workflow_type\", action_type=~\"$action_type\"}[$__range])) * 60",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false
        }
      ]
    },
