    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Unattributed to a workflow type",
      "description": "Share of billable actions in range whose temporal_workflow_type is the unattributed sentinel ($unattributed_re, which includes the empty string). These actions are billed but invisible to the Workflow type filter, so they vanish from every breakdown the moment a specific workflow type is selected - which is what makes the totals above and the breakdowns below disagree. Deliberately IGNORES the Workflow type filter. The exact sentinel Cloud emits is unverified on this account (see Method).",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 5,
        "x": 15,
        "y": 7
