    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Feed liveness (${stale_grace_min} min)",
      "description": "Has ANY billable-action sample for the selected namespaces landed in the last $stale_grace_min minutes. The Cloud OpenMetrics endpoint publishes roughly 3.5 min behind wall clock on this account, so the grace window defaults to 7 - a 3-minute window is permanently empty here. FEED SILENT is not the same as zero actions: Cloud omits the series entirely when a namespace is idle, so a quiet namespace also reads silent.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 4,
        "x": 20,
        "y": 7
